      ],
      answer: 1,
      why: 'NZ first asked voters which system they preferred (1992, indicative), then chose it (1993), then an independent commission drew the rules and boundaries — insulating the redesign from incumbent self-interest. Contrast referendums run by governing parties on rules governing themselves.',
    },
  ],
